Willow Creek Farm Preserve, Pennsylvania. Certified Organic.

[[Melissa Smith]] grazes Shetland sheep in rotation among trees ([[Silvopasture]]) and runs a wool mill on the farm.

The wool for the [[Oka Chair]] is grown, washed, picked, and carded here. See [[Waste Wool]].
